	(property "Description" "USB Type-C receptacle 24P vertical SMD, USB 3.1 Gen2 + DP Alt Mode. Mouth 10.50 mm above board. 20 V / 3 A, 5000 mating cycles, -30..+80 C - all off the DRAWING. The LCSC listing claims 5 A / 10000 cycles / -40..+85 C and is wrong on all three; do not 'correct' these back from the catalogue page. 5000 cycles is HALF the outgoing right-angle C456013 and is the one real regression in this swap."
